["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">舞う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">跳舞；舞蹈（原为旋转舞）；旋转；飘动；盘旋；飞舞；翻滚；转圈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197416\">ヒラヒラと<ruby>桜<rp>(</rp><rt>さくら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>花<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>舞<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。もうお<ruby>花見<rp>(</rp><rt>はなみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>季節<rp>(</rp><rt>きせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わりだな。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">希拉希拉和樱桃的花朵正在奔跑,花卉季节也已经结束了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">真上</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まうえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">正上方；正上空；正头顶</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">前</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">在...前面；在...面前（如建筑物前）；以前；早先；之前；前；（距整点差）...分；前面；前部；前头；排头；前方；前面；当面；面前；前一（如：前页）；先前的；上一个的；前半的；前者的；一份；一人份；身体前部；衣服前襟（西装、和服等）；下体；私处；犯罪记录；前科</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">前売り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まえうり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><s