">委托；托付；交托</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199934\">トムは<ruby>今年<rp>(</rp><rt>ことし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のテニストーナメントを<ruby>任<rp>(</rp><rt>まか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">汤姆将担任今年的网球赛事。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">負かす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まかす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">击败；战胜；打败</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229558\">あんなやつを<ruby>負<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かすのはお<ruby>茶<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さいさいだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这样的人,就是喝茶的孩子。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">任せる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まかせる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">委托；交付；托付；听任；任凭；听之任之；充分利用；尽情使用；毫无保留地使用</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217085\">ご<ruby>想像<rp>(</rp><rt>そうぞう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にお<ruby>任<rp>(</rp><rt>まか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せします。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我把你想象的担任。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">賄う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まかなう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">筹措；供应</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>収入<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうにゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だけでは<ruby>生活費<rp>(</rp><rt>せいかつひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>賄<rp>(</rp><rt>まかな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">光靠收入维持不了生活费。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">曲る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まがる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">弯曲；弯折；翘曲；蜿蜒；扭曲；转向；转弯；歪斜；不正；扭曲不正</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">巻</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">卷；卷轴；（钟表等的）上弦；卷紧；卷；册；加速；提速；（日式木屐的）鞋跟</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">紛らわしい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まぎらわしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">容易混淆的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">この<ruby>二<rp>(</rp><rt>ふた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つの<ruby>漢字<rp>(</rp><rt>かんじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>形<rp>(</rp><rt>かたち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>紛<rp>(</rp><rt>まぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らわしい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这两个汉字字形容易混淆。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">紛れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まぎれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">消失在；混入；隐没于；趁乱进行；利用混乱；极为相似；难以分辨；容易混淆；转移；忘却；被吸引；沉溺于；专注于</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"82520\"><ruby>忙<rp>(</rp><rt>いそが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しさに<ruby>紛<rp>(</rp><rt>まぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れて、ごぶさたしておりました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">因为忙碌,我被打破了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">巻く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">缠绕；卷起；包裹；戴（头巾、围巾等）；包住；笼罩；迂回；绕过；联句；提前（三小时等）；提前进行</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125924\"><ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>巻<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かれろ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把它包围在漫长的事情上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">幕</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">幕；帷幕；幕（戏剧的一场）；幕落；闭幕；终；结束；闭幕；情况；场合；角色；部分；幕内（相扑最高级别）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212886\">そのとき<ruby>幕<rp>(</rp><rt>まく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあきかけていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那时,幕子被放弃了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">撒く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">撒；洒；散布；分发；散发；甩掉；摆脱；甩脱</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\