\"ja\">まくる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">卷起；翻起（如袖子等）；反复做；不顾一切地做；连续地做；翻盘；逆转（在麻将、赛马等中）；后来居上</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"184069\"><ruby>株主<rp>(</rp><rt>かぶぬし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはもうけまくっています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">股东们已经陷入困境。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">負け</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まけ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">失败；败北；输；辜负；有负；折扣；亏本</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200688\">どっちに<ruby>転<rp>(</rp><rt>ころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでも<ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>負<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けだよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">无论你跌倒在哪个地方,都是你的失败。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">負ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">失败；被击败；被打败；屈服；让步；退缩；投降；被压倒；不如；次于；被...比下去；长疹子；出疹；降价；打折；额外赠送</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"235276\">３<ruby>対<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>０で<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>負<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">3对0对他输了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">曲げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a 